WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 15]

01:58.660 --> 02:00.140
The... the Lord of Xiaonan

02:00.420 --> 02:01.020
rebelled.

02:04.900 --> 02:05.540
Return at once

02:05.740 --> 02:06.620
to tell Her Highness.

02:08.460 --> 02:08.980
Your Highness,

02:09.300 --> 02:10.340
Xiao Xun killed the dispatch riders.

02:10.940 --> 02:12.140
We've lost contact with the Capital.

02:13.100 --> 02:14.300
All post houses along the way

02:14.420 --> 02:15.380
are under his control.

02:16.180 --> 02:17.020
Rumors reached the Capital.

02:17.820 --> 02:18.900
Northern Desert Army breached Bailang Pass.

02:19.620 --> 02:20.660
Yunzhong will fall in three days.

02:21.260 --> 02:21.820
They'll march

02:22.700 --> 02:23.580
for the imperial city.

02:25.580 --> 02:26.660
How's the Capital?

02:27.140 --> 02:28.580
Fifty thousand troops in the capital camp

02:28.700 --> 02:29.460
and one hundred thousand nearby.

02:29.620 --> 02:30.540
Why should we fear Xiao Xun?

02:31.020 --> 02:32.660
What we fear is that the commoners

02:32.780 --> 02:33.860
believe Xiao Xun's lie

02:33.940 --> 02:35.140
to defend the Capital.

02:35.940 --> 02:36.500
In that case,

02:37.100 --> 02:38.420
he can rightfully lead his troops

02:38.420 --> 02:39.180
into the city.

02:40.340 --> 02:41.660
If Xiao Xun enters the Capital,

02:42.700 --> 02:44.140
Yu's life will be in danger.

02:45.300 --> 02:46.420
Xie Yanfang is by Yu's side.

02:47.540 --> 02:48.460
He's ruthless.

02:49.740 --> 02:51.140
But his clan relies on Yu.

02:52.100 --> 02:53.540
Xie Yanfang will protect him.

02:55.180 --> 02:56.020
You're right.

02:56.900 --> 02:58.700
Xie Yanfang still has

02:58.700 --> 02:59.900
a crucial trick.

03:00.380 --> 03:01.140
This time,

03:02.300 --> 03:03.780
he'll definitely make this move.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.180
Get Xiaoman to me.

03:06.980 --> 03:07.380
Yes.

03:28.900 --> 03:30.940
[Chu Zhao]

03:43.140 --> 03:44.220
Whatever you want me to do,

03:44.420 --> 03:45.420
let me know.

03:45.980 --> 03:47.180
All post houses along the way

03:47.380 --> 03:48.140
have been cut off.

03:48.500 --> 03:49.900
I want you to take your men

03:50.300 --> 03:51.780
to bypass the post houses

03:51.820 --> 03:52.620
and head for the Capital.

03:52.940 --> 03:54.180
Then, escort my cousin Chu Tang

03:54.180 --> 03:54.900
and her family

03:54.940 --> 03:55.700
out of the Capital.

03:56.580 --> 03:57.740
Why all the trouble?

03:57.900 --> 03:58.820
Why don't we let her

03:58.860 --> 04:00.020
bring the news of the frontier

04:00.020 --> 04:00.820
to the Capital?

04:01.060 --> 04:02.020
Who would believe

04:02.500 --> 04:03.100
a bandit?

04:04.420 --> 04:05.780
The public opinion in the Capital

04:05.980 --> 04:07.260
completely favors Xiao Xun

04:07.620 --> 04:08.460
who "guards" His Majesty.

04:10.900 --> 04:11.980
Then what is the problem

04:11.980 --> 04:12.820
of Chu Tang's family?

04:13.380 --> 04:14.700
Chu Lan is a mere civil official.

04:14.700 --> 04:15.460
What danger

04:15.580 --> 04:16.540
justifies all the effort

04:16.540 --> 04:17.220
to save him?

04:17.860 --> 04:18.780
In Anping Rebellion,

04:19.260 --> 04:20.780
Xiao Xun used my uncle

04:20.780 --> 04:21.580
to kill His Majesty.

04:21.980 --> 04:23.260
Now, he's the key witness.

04:23.620 --> 04:25.140
All parties will fight over him.

04:26.580 --> 04:27.220
I count on you.

04:28.140 --> 04:29.300
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

04:34.620 --> 04:35.260
What about you?

04:36.060 --> 04:36.780
To the Capital?

04:37.940 --> 04:38.460
No.

04:43.100 --> 04:44.380
I'm going somewhere else.

04:53.740 --> 04:54.220
Father.

04:55.820 --> 04:56.260
Mother.

04:57.940 --> 04:59.340
You were separated half your lives.

05:00.380 --> 05:01.820
Now you're finally reunited

05:03.060 --> 05:04.220
in the underworld.

05:05.900 --> 05:06.500
Sadly,

05:08.980 --> 05:10.100
I have to leave.

05:11.620 --> 05:13.020
I'll keep defending the city

05:14.700 --> 05:15.620
Father left undefended.

05:18.020 --> 05:19.300
I'll continue the war

05:20.940 --> 05:21.940
Father left unfinished.

05:24.100 --> 05:25.540
Mother dreamed of peace

05:25.540 --> 05:26.660
all over the world.

05:28.860 --> 05:30.540
I'll make it come true.

05:53.380 --> 05:54.940
[The Capital]

05:56.660 --> 05:57.900
I've heard Xiao Xun

05:57.900 --> 05:59.020
has reached Baili Pavilion.

05:59.540 --> 06:00.620
A noble heir like him

06:00.620 --> 06:01.820
is always reliable.

06:02.300 --> 06:03.100
I believe soon,

06:03.100 --> 06:04.660
he'll rescue the Capital from danger.

06:05.740 --> 06:07.100
He's been practicing martial arts since childhood

06:07.340 --> 06:08.860
and he leads elite troops.

06:09.220 --> 06:11.500
Hope he'll arrive soon.

06:12.140 --> 06:13.300
Since General Chu died,

06:13.700 --> 06:14.460
Yunzhong troops

06:14.500 --> 06:16.060
have been in utter chaos.

06:16.380 --> 06:18.260
They won't bother with the Capital.

06:18.700 --> 06:19.980
Luckily, His Highness

06:19.980 --> 06:20.740
is on his way here.

06:21.420 --> 06:22.420
Fair enough.

06:23.260 --> 06:24.900
The Grand Princess is brave,

06:25.420 --> 06:27.100
but she's too young.

06:27.500 --> 06:29.420
We have to count on real royal members

06:29.900 --> 06:30.900
to guard the Capital

06:30.940 --> 06:33.060
and protect our state.

06:35.380 --> 06:35.980
Jiang,

06:36.180 --> 06:37.100
the weather is lovely.

06:37.500 --> 06:38.940
Take Tang out for some fresh air.

06:39.780 --> 06:41.020
The tea has gone cold.

06:41.700 --> 06:42.780
The conversation is ironic.

06:43.260 --> 06:44.060
If she stays longer,

06:44.420 --> 06:45.300
she'll feel sick.

06:48.380 --> 06:49.740
Goodbye, then.

06:50.340 --> 06:50.980
Jiang.

06:52.500 --> 06:53.820
Why is she angry again?

06:58.540 --> 07:00.380
Mr. Xiao Xun is noble.

07:01.020 --> 07:02.300
Had General Chu not built

07:02.700 --> 07:04.060
the city walls at great cost...

07:04.420 --> 07:05.860
Had Her Highness not guarded Wangcheng...

07:06.660 --> 07:07.820
You couldn't be sitting here,

07:08.380 --> 07:09.580
enjoying cold tea,

07:09.700 --> 07:10.460
or satirizing them.

07:11.540 --> 07:12.300
I advise you

07:12.340 --> 07:13.100
hold your tongues.

07:21.100 --> 07:21.580
Jiang,

07:22.860 --> 07:23.860
I have a favor to ask.

07:24.500 --> 07:26.260
We're friends. Don't say that.

07:26.380 --> 07:27.100
What is it?

07:27.900 --> 07:29.180
I need help from your family.

07:32.940 --> 07:34.580
Mr. Xie, to what do I owe

07:35.420 --> 07:36.620
the honor of this visit?

07:43.220 --> 07:44.980
I'm here to ask you, Mr. Deng.

07:46.700 --> 07:48.460
Do you really choose

07:50.620 --> 07:52.140
to throw your life away with Xiao Xun?

07:56.740 --> 07:57.820
What do you mean?

07:58.860 --> 08:01.020
I don't understand.

08:03.660 --> 08:05.180
Xiao Xun has reached Baili Pavilion.

08:05.900 --> 08:06.980
He keeps releasing messages

08:07.940 --> 08:09.580
that he's coming to protect His Majesty.

08:09.980 --> 08:11.260
He expects a wide-open city gate

08:11.500 --> 08:13.260
where people line up to welcome him.

08:13.780 --> 08:14.940
But do you know

08:15.420 --> 08:16.500
how we will

08:17.380 --> 08:18.380
end up

08:19.140 --> 08:20.740
if the city gate is open to him?

08:21.540 --> 08:22.780
Since it's the will of people,

08:23.580 --> 08:24.740
you should try to stop

08:24.740 --> 08:26.100
the people in the Capital.

08:26.620 --> 08:28.020
What's the point of coming here

08:29.020 --> 08:30.020
to stop me?

08:32.180 --> 08:33.780
Looks like you're determined

08:34.740 --> 08:36.380
to side with Mr. Xiao.

08:36.740 --> 08:38.380
They're within the defense line.

08:39.180 --> 08:40.500
The Capital is just ahead.

08:41.220 --> 08:42.700
If His Majesty still refuses

08:42.700 --> 08:43.460
to open the gate,

08:43.980 --> 08:44.820
their advance will be

08:44.940 --> 08:45.940
an unauthorized move

08:45.940 --> 08:46.820
and willful treason.

08:47.700 --> 08:48.940
After they enter the city,

08:49.380 --> 08:50.620
you might as well

08:50.820 --> 08:51.820
find an excuse

08:51.820 --> 08:52.460
to kill them.

08:53.340 --> 08:55.180
You know people's will is irreversible.

08:56.220 --> 08:56.860
In their eyes,

08:56.860 --> 08:58.500
Xiao Xun

08:59.540 --> 09:01.020
is a meritorious protector

09:01.100 --> 09:02.140
they're expecting.

09:03.020 --> 09:04.820
If His Majesty still refuses,

09:05.140 --> 09:06.660
people will complain.

09:07.180 --> 09:08.060
So, Mr. Xie,

09:09.220 --> 09:10.260
what do you intend to do?

09:15.660 --> 09:17.300
We must make Xiao Xun

09:18.060 --> 09:20.380
a rebel again.

09:20.860 --> 09:22.180
Are you saying

09:23.140 --> 09:24.980
you'll prove his father's treason?

09:25.420 --> 09:26.180
Only in this way

09:26.900 --> 09:28.620
can we stop Xiao Xun from entering town.

09:29.100 --> 09:30.300
If he attacks by force,

09:30.900 --> 09:32.540
all the people will know

09:32.820 --> 09:34.340
that the court has no choice

09:34.420 --> 09:35.460
but to fight back.

09:36.060 --> 09:37.620
If the war breaks out,

09:38.020 --> 09:40.900
the court will be rightful.

09:41.660 --> 09:43.380
We'll have no more worries

09:43.820 --> 09:45.740
and all the people will submit.

09:46.820 --> 09:48.300
Then no one will question

09:50.220 --> 09:51.980
Yu's throne.

09:52.500 --> 09:54.060
Then how will you prove

09:54.100 --> 09:55.300
the treason of the Lord of Xiaonan?

09:55.940 --> 09:56.940
Do you know

09:57.860 --> 09:59.900
Chu Lan was bribed by Xiao Xun

10:00.740 --> 10:01.700
to poison Yu

10:02.620 --> 10:04.100
in Chu Mansion?

10:04.300 --> 10:05.740
You'll use Chu Lan as a scapegoat?

10:06.900 --> 10:07.740
Have you considered?

10:08.500 --> 10:09.580
If Chu Lan gets in trouble,

10:10.260 --> 10:11.940
the Chu Family will be implicated.

10:12.500 --> 10:13.460
Then the Grand Princess

10:13.460 --> 10:14.900
can hardly stay out of trouble.

10:15.940 --> 10:17.220
Great achievements

10:18.460 --> 10:19.540
require great sacrifices.

10:20.540 --> 10:21.580
Only when we expose

10:21.580 --> 10:22.780
Xiao Xun's scheme

10:23.660 --> 10:24.780
can the two of us

10:26.220 --> 10:27.820
keep the city gate

10:28.340 --> 10:29.500
firmly shut.

10:30.100 --> 10:30.740
Isn't that so?

10:33.020 --> 10:34.620
I'm still curious about one thing.

10:35.980 --> 10:37.140
Xiao Xun wrote a letter

10:37.140 --> 10:38.180
to you.

10:38.780 --> 10:39.500
What was in...?

10:54.660 --> 10:55.820
After all that talking,

10:56.340 --> 10:57.620
I finally get it.

10:58.580 --> 10:59.300
You think

10:59.300 --> 11:00.340
Chu Lan isn't enough.

11:00.540 --> 11:02.100
You'll also get me involved

11:03.180 --> 11:05.260
to prove their treason.

11:06.780 --> 11:08.300
But have you thought about this?

11:08.900 --> 11:10.380
Is it a righteous war?

11:10.580 --> 11:11.820
Is it justified?

11:12.300 --> 11:12.980
You care.

11:13.300 --> 11:14.140
His Majesty cares.

11:15.700 --> 11:16.820
But I don't care.

11:18.900 --> 11:20.460
Don't try to keep your clan innocent

11:20.900 --> 11:23.060
by ruining my reputation.

11:30.420 --> 11:31.260
You're wrong again.

11:33.140 --> 11:33.820
I just came here

11:33.820 --> 11:35.580
to give you a favor.

11:37.860 --> 11:39.700
Instead of keeping some secrets buried,

11:42.340 --> 11:44.380
why not turn them into your achievements?

11:55.940 --> 11:56.500
My Lord.

12:05.460 --> 12:07.620
Xie Yanfang wants to kill two birds with one stone.

12:17.620 --> 12:19.460
[To open the gate or not]

12:25.140 --> 12:25.820
Get ready.

12:26.540 --> 12:27.780
I'll see Chu Lan tonight.

12:28.900 --> 12:30.500
[Chu Mansion]

12:40.300 --> 12:41.460
My Lord, we looked everywhere.

12:41.540 --> 12:42.460
No one is in.

12:44.980 --> 12:46.340
We asked the neighbors.

12:46.660 --> 12:47.780
Nothing unusual was noticed.

12:48.700 --> 12:49.860
During the day, Chu Tang

12:49.860 --> 12:51.620
even had tea with some ladies.

12:52.060 --> 12:52.740
As she came home,

12:52.740 --> 12:53.900
she vanished into thin air.

12:54.820 --> 12:56.100
We may have early plans,

12:56.900 --> 12:58.580
but someone's always earlier.

12:59.220 --> 13:00.540
As soon as we had the idea,

13:01.700 --> 13:03.300
they had run away.

13:03.780 --> 13:05.100
How could they leave so perfectly?

13:05.620 --> 13:06.660
Theoretically,

13:06.900 --> 13:08.260
when Chu Zhao is away,

13:08.660 --> 13:10.060
Chu Lan should be isolated

13:10.060 --> 13:11.820
from the court.

13:12.540 --> 13:13.620
And Chu Lan doesn't look

13:13.620 --> 13:14.860
like he can read the situation.

13:15.500 --> 13:16.460
Is it possible

13:17.220 --> 13:17.980
that Her Highness

13:17.980 --> 13:18.980
sent them a message?

13:19.700 --> 13:21.180
Xiao Xun intercepted all the messages.

13:22.500 --> 13:24.160
How did Chu Zhao manage

13:24.180 --> 13:24.860
to send one?

13:31.660 --> 13:33.940
Xie Yanfang used up all his schemes.

13:34.620 --> 13:36.460
But his own ally

13:36.460 --> 13:37.460
stabbed him in the back.

13:39.420 --> 13:41.220
Send a message to Mr. Xie.

13:42.060 --> 13:44.140
Tell him the witness he longs for

13:47.140 --> 13:48.740
has fled.

13:49.460 --> 13:50.540
[Xie Residence]

13:50.540 --> 13:51.660
How come he fled?

13:52.660 --> 13:54.100
The Grand Princess has

13:55.700 --> 13:58.180
more political support than I imagined.

13:58.900 --> 14:00.460
Of the clans who have ties with Chu Family,

14:01.020 --> 14:02.340
five left the city yesterday.

14:03.260 --> 14:03.780
Some said

14:04.140 --> 14:05.300
they went to rural houses.

14:05.740 --> 14:06.940
Some said they had an outing.

14:07.500 --> 14:07.980
And...

14:08.340 --> 14:09.220
Today, three ladies

14:09.220 --> 14:10.380
met with Chu Tang in the day.

14:10.980 --> 14:11.860
Shall we pursue them?

14:18.620 --> 14:19.940
It is time for us

14:22.580 --> 14:23.940
to go out and visit someone.

14:26.220 --> 14:29.100
[Side residence of Zhou family]

14:48.460 --> 14:49.380
Be careful, Mr. Chu.

14:49.700 --> 14:50.540
Come on, sweetheart.

14:54.420 --> 14:54.740
Hurry.

14:55.020 --> 14:55.540
Come, Tang.

15:02.900 --> 15:03.540
Jiang,

15:04.420 --> 15:05.140
thank you.

15:05.860 --> 15:06.620
My pleasure.

15:07.300 --> 15:08.260
Don't thank me.

15:08.820 --> 15:10.340
Without my grandfather's approval,

15:10.620 --> 15:11.660
I couldn't have helped you

15:12.260 --> 15:13.220
even if I wanted to.

15:13.940 --> 15:14.460
Jiang,

15:14.980 --> 15:15.700
I need you

15:16.300 --> 15:17.380
to help my family leave.

15:17.660 --> 15:18.700
Why me?

15:18.940 --> 15:19.860
Shouldn't you

15:20.060 --> 15:21.460
beg some clan heads?

15:22.460 --> 15:23.820
I was told to ask them.

15:24.540 --> 15:25.980
But big clans have deep connections

15:26.180 --> 15:27.060
with shared interests.

15:27.900 --> 15:28.260
I...

15:29.860 --> 15:30.860
I thought about it.

15:31.620 --> 15:32.380
You're the only one

15:32.980 --> 15:34.300
I can entrust my life to.

15:35.860 --> 15:36.820
At the Hai hour tonight,

15:37.020 --> 15:37.780
my carriage will

15:37.780 --> 15:39.580
pick you up at the back door of Chu Mansion.

15:40.860 --> 15:41.580
I shall remember

15:43.660 --> 15:45.260
your great favor.

15:47.660 --> 15:48.420
Go get some rest.

16:03.620 --> 16:04.460
Come on, Tang.

16:04.980 --> 16:06.180
Your uncle and his daughter

16:06.180 --> 16:06.940
are so useless.

16:07.220 --> 16:08.300
We shouldn't have

16:08.300 --> 16:09.780
expected them to bring glory.

16:10.820 --> 16:11.180
You...

16:13.340 --> 16:15.180
Luckily, our daughter is farsighted

16:15.420 --> 16:16.860
and gets along with other noble ladies.

16:18.580 --> 16:20.180
Madam, you sound so proud.

16:21.500 --> 16:22.420
Do you really think

16:22.620 --> 16:23.860
her mere friendship can

16:23.860 --> 16:25.140
get you through the city defense?

16:26.380 --> 16:27.260
The Grand Princess

16:27.260 --> 16:28.300
arranged deceptive schemes

16:28.580 --> 16:29.420
and sent bandits

16:29.580 --> 16:30.620
to clear enemy sentries.

16:31.100 --> 16:32.460
Otherwise, you wouldn't

16:32.540 --> 16:33.900
have come here alive.

16:34.020 --> 16:35.780
You... You are...

16:35.820 --> 16:36.220
Yes.

16:36.860 --> 16:37.980
We're the bandits,

16:37.980 --> 16:38.660
whom people like you

16:39.180 --> 16:39.820
despise most.

16:45.660 --> 16:46.540
Her Highness sent me

16:46.540 --> 16:46.940
to get you.

16:47.020 --> 16:47.460
Don't yell.

16:48.020 --> 16:49.180
Nod and I'll let you go.

17:00.380 --> 17:01.980
Lord of Xiaonan isn't a defender,

17:02.420 --> 17:03.740
but a usurper.

17:04.660 --> 17:06.220
To reveal Xiao Xun's true colors,

17:06.700 --> 17:08.140
the court will dig up the evidence

17:08.380 --> 17:09.500
your father nearly killed

17:09.500 --> 17:10.220
the young emperor.

17:11.020 --> 17:11.540
Danger.

17:13.820 --> 17:14.460
Her Highness said

17:14.740 --> 17:15.780
the heads of these clans

17:15.780 --> 17:16.380
are reliable.

17:16.700 --> 17:17.660
Go ask them for help.

17:22.260 --> 17:23.060
[Chu Zhao]

17:23.780 --> 17:24.260
Darling.

17:24.580 --> 17:25.620
Xiaoman, let's leave.

17:26.260 --> 17:27.820
This is a bestowal to Jiang's ancestors.

17:28.300 --> 17:29.900
It must be on record with the Ministry of War.

17:30.620 --> 17:31.460
Within half a day,

17:31.980 --> 17:33.420
we will all get caught.

17:34.460 --> 17:35.020
Tang,

17:35.500 --> 17:36.500
how could you still

17:36.660 --> 17:37.660
doubt the Zhou Family?

17:37.900 --> 17:38.940
Just now, Miss Zhou seemed

17:39.100 --> 17:40.900
she truly wanted to help us.

17:41.140 --> 17:41.660
Father,

17:42.060 --> 17:43.900
Jiang truly wants to help us.

17:44.580 --> 17:45.060
That's why

17:45.500 --> 17:46.860
we can't get her involved.

17:47.260 --> 17:47.860
But they...

17:47.860 --> 17:48.540
Stop lingering.

17:48.820 --> 17:49.380
Go with me.

17:50.980 --> 17:51.340
Let's go.

17:51.660 --> 17:51.940
Hurry.

17:51.940 --> 17:52.420
But they...

17:52.980 --> 17:53.820
Oh, Darling.

18:24.900 --> 18:26.900
[Zhou Bing, Minister of Rites]

18:27.940 --> 18:28.420
My Lord,

18:29.180 --> 18:30.180
Chu Lan's trail is gone.

18:43.340 --> 18:44.460
Mr. Zhou, you really made

18:44.460 --> 18:45.740
very cunning moves.

18:51.860 --> 18:52.660
No offense,

18:55.700 --> 18:57.180
but I gave up a piece to get ahead.

19:02.420 --> 19:03.260
Mr. Xie,

19:03.660 --> 19:06.380
you're still so enigmatic when playing Liubo.

19:10.460 --> 19:12.340
I wonder what you're fighting for

19:12.700 --> 19:15.940
in this round.

19:20.900 --> 19:22.620
When the Lord of Xuan played with me,

19:23.860 --> 19:26.060
he wrongfully killed a loyal man over one piece.

19:27.140 --> 19:28.020
In today's game,

19:29.260 --> 19:31.220
I'm fighting for His Majesty's life.

19:41.460 --> 19:42.740
Lord of Xiaonan and his heir

19:43.100 --> 19:44.140
nearly took

19:44.140 --> 19:45.060
His Majesty's life.

19:46.100 --> 19:47.380
Chu Lan is the witness.

19:48.100 --> 19:49.100
So, I hope you will

19:49.500 --> 19:50.260
help His Majesty

19:50.820 --> 19:52.780
to reveal the truth to people.

20:07.660 --> 20:08.540
Over generations,

20:09.140 --> 20:10.860
my clan has been a bystander.

20:11.580 --> 20:12.180
Mr. Xie,

20:12.540 --> 20:14.340
you don't need to probe me like this.

20:15.220 --> 20:17.020
I don't know

20:17.420 --> 20:19.300
where Chu Lan is.

20:24.900 --> 20:25.620
Mr. Zhou,

20:27.180 --> 20:28.980
you must know no one can be

20:30.420 --> 20:32.700
a bystander in chaotic times.

20:34.820 --> 20:35.220
My Lord,

20:35.340 --> 20:35.820
we've searched.

20:36.060 --> 20:36.460
Nothing.

20:38.420 --> 20:38.900
Yes.

20:43.020 --> 20:43.940
Sorry for the offense.

20:44.780 --> 20:45.780
I'll take my leave.

20:48.460 --> 20:48.860
Oh.

20:50.900 --> 20:51.860
It's too windy tonight.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.980
Remember to close your windows.

20:58.620 --> 20:59.500
Mr. Xie,

21:00.260 --> 21:01.300
please see yourself out.

21:04.460 --> 21:05.500
My Lady, be careful.

21:08.860 --> 21:09.500
Father.

21:10.220 --> 21:10.740
The carriage

21:10.900 --> 21:11.980
that took them out of town

21:11.980 --> 21:12.500
is back.

21:13.100 --> 21:14.420
Shall we make early preparations?

21:14.900 --> 21:15.700
If Mr. Xie

21:15.820 --> 21:16.980
really finds out something,

21:17.060 --> 21:17.380
then...

21:17.460 --> 21:19.700
Jiang did something reckless.

21:20.420 --> 21:21.740
But since we promised to help,

21:22.620 --> 21:23.780
we won't complain.

21:29.500 --> 21:31.220
Between the Grand Princess

21:31.540 --> 21:32.900
and Mr. Xie,

21:32.900 --> 21:33.780
there will be

21:36.020 --> 21:37.660
a long game of strategy.

21:38.500 --> 21:40.500
[Xie Residence]

21:40.580 --> 21:41.860
Welcome, Mr. Deng.

21:42.500 --> 21:43.860
We are honored by your presence.

21:51.780 --> 21:53.100
This orchid is very delicate.

21:54.460 --> 21:55.860
No strangers shall touch it.

21:56.500 --> 21:58.140
You tend this flower so well.

21:58.940 --> 21:59.820
Sadly,

22:00.580 --> 22:01.620
its roots have rotted.

22:02.940 --> 22:04.620
It barely appears to bloom.

22:06.020 --> 22:07.300
You've searched the whole day.

22:08.420 --> 22:09.780
Have you found what you're after?

22:15.740 --> 22:17.700
The Grand Princess is so far away,

22:18.580 --> 22:20.580
but big clans give her generous support.

22:21.860 --> 22:24.020
She does have great influence.

22:24.900 --> 22:25.780
You didn't come here

22:26.460 --> 22:27.580
just to satirize me,

22:27.580 --> 22:28.340
did you?

22:29.340 --> 22:31.540
Do you know where Chu Zhao is?

22:32.580 --> 22:33.900
She's riding at full speed

22:33.900 --> 22:35.140
toward Xiaonan.

22:35.660 --> 22:36.940
Does she think Xiao Xun

22:36.940 --> 22:39.180
will retreat when his father is trapped?

22:41.580 --> 22:42.820
How childish.

22:43.260 --> 22:45.420
Her Highness will suppress the rebels on His Majesty's behalf.

22:46.540 --> 22:47.420
What's wrong with it?

22:48.660 --> 22:49.980
Her Highness has great influence.

22:50.740 --> 22:51.460
Since she dares,

22:52.460 --> 22:53.700
she must be confident enough.

22:54.260 --> 22:54.740
Yeah.

22:55.700 --> 22:56.660
You and Her Highness

22:56.660 --> 22:57.780
used to have the same goal.

22:58.060 --> 23:00.060
You were both against Xiao Xun.

23:00.420 --> 23:01.460
But you insist

23:01.500 --> 23:03.380
on using Chu Lan as a scapegoat

23:03.660 --> 23:05.980
and getting her clan involved.

23:07.100 --> 23:07.980
Obviously,

23:09.260 --> 23:10.900
Chu Zhao wouldn't agree.

23:11.460 --> 23:12.940
That's a bit much, Mr. Deng.

23:14.740 --> 23:16.540
As long as you approve the edict

23:16.860 --> 23:18.180
that Xiao Xun instigated Chu Lan

23:18.300 --> 23:20.700
to poison the imperial grandson,

23:21.540 --> 23:23.740
Her Highness will be suppressing the rebels

23:24.020 --> 23:24.940
with a valid reason.

23:25.900 --> 23:27.100
I'm helping her,

23:28.100 --> 23:28.700
aren't I?

23:31.900 --> 23:33.660
Have you heard about this?

23:34.580 --> 23:37.380
An orchid dies, but its fragrance will linger.

23:38.260 --> 23:39.220
Someone

23:41.060 --> 23:42.700
only gets in the way when he's alive.

23:44.500 --> 23:45.900
Mr. Xie, you have

23:46.740 --> 23:48.060
a very clever plan.

23:50.260 --> 23:51.460
I'll take my leave.

23:55.580 --> 23:56.220
Mr. Deng.

23:58.820 --> 24:00.220
We're just serving the state

24:01.180 --> 24:02.660
by cutting out the deadwood.

24:16.300 --> 24:17.060
What's this?

24:17.700 --> 24:19.060
Why is Zhao guilty?

24:21.260 --> 24:22.340
Don't, Your Majesty.

24:35.140 --> 24:35.620
Your Majesty,

24:37.100 --> 24:37.940
this edict says

24:38.420 --> 24:39.980
her uncle Chu Lan is guilty.

24:40.780 --> 24:41.420
Did you forget?

24:42.060 --> 24:43.420
He tried to poison you back then.

24:44.100 --> 24:44.900
So, Her Highness

24:45.020 --> 24:46.300
took you away from her family.

24:47.060 --> 24:48.660
So, Chu Lan is really guilty.

24:50.460 --> 24:51.300
Then why did no one

24:51.300 --> 24:52.140
tell me about it?

24:53.020 --> 24:53.620
Chu Lan

24:53.820 --> 24:55.100
is Zhao's uncle.

24:55.540 --> 24:56.180
If he's guilty,

24:56.820 --> 24:58.540
she will be implicated.

24:58.980 --> 25:00.420
Now, the situation is complicated.

25:01.500 --> 25:02.860
Lord of Xiaonan and his heir

25:02.860 --> 25:03.660
intend rebellion.

25:04.180 --> 25:05.700
Xiao Xun is coming as a defender.

25:06.420 --> 25:07.660
Our people support him.

25:08.380 --> 25:09.580
Ministers want the city gate

25:09.580 --> 25:10.380
to be opened too.

25:11.060 --> 25:12.980
But if he leads his 100,000 troops into town

25:13.420 --> 25:15.140
without firing a single shot,

25:16.260 --> 25:17.420
we won't be able to resist.

25:17.980 --> 25:19.260
The casualties will be terrible.

25:21.020 --> 25:22.260
What we should do now

25:23.340 --> 25:25.260
is let the entire world know

25:25.260 --> 25:26.900
the sins of Xiao Xun and his father.

25:27.820 --> 25:29.140
Then we'll all rise against them.

25:32.340 --> 25:33.780
You're bullying Zhao.

25:34.260 --> 25:35.660
You're bullying her

25:36.300 --> 25:37.580
just because her father is gone.

25:41.740 --> 25:42.420
Yu,

25:44.980 --> 25:45.900
no one is bullying

25:45.900 --> 25:46.980
your sister.

25:47.460 --> 25:48.740
If she were here now,

25:50.180 --> 25:51.420
she would do the same.

25:56.900 --> 25:58.260
The post houses have been cut off.

25:58.780 --> 25:59.700
But the men I sent out

25:59.700 --> 26:00.380
learnt something.

26:01.180 --> 26:03.420
Xiao Xun intercepted a victory report.

26:03.980 --> 26:04.780
Not long ago,

26:05.300 --> 26:06.100
Chu Zhao led a raid

26:06.100 --> 26:07.980
against Northern Desert Royal Army,

26:08.380 --> 26:09.740
driving them back a hundred li.

26:11.420 --> 26:12.100
And later,

26:13.060 --> 26:14.860
the enemy relaunched an attack.

26:15.340 --> 26:16.580
Once again, she led troops

26:17.100 --> 26:18.140
to crush them.

26:19.180 --> 26:19.700
She did?

26:21.660 --> 26:22.300
What's more,

26:23.020 --> 26:24.540
on hearing Xiao Xun was leading troops

26:24.540 --> 26:25.940
to surround the Capital,

26:26.300 --> 26:28.580
she led forces to attack Xiaonan.

26:29.300 --> 26:30.380
Do you know why?

26:31.540 --> 26:32.340
"Besiege Wei to rescue Zhao."

26:32.540 --> 26:33.420
I've read about that.

26:34.980 --> 26:35.660
That's right.

26:37.220 --> 26:38.420
So you don't need to worry.

26:39.140 --> 26:40.140
Your sister

26:40.220 --> 26:41.420
fears nothing.

26:42.020 --> 26:43.540
No one can bully her easily.

26:44.180 --> 26:45.580
She's defending our state

26:45.940 --> 26:46.580
and our people.

26:47.140 --> 26:48.380
Even when her uncle is guilty,

26:49.180 --> 26:50.580
she won't be implicated.

26:52.300 --> 26:53.180
Do you trust me?

26:54.660 --> 26:55.460
I trust you.

27:20.300 --> 27:22.300
[Xiaonan Prefecture]

27:29.060 --> 27:30.060
I never thought

27:31.260 --> 27:33.220
I could have a battle

27:33.220 --> 27:34.420
against the Grand Princess.

27:35.380 --> 27:36.620
How dare she besiege us

27:36.660 --> 27:38.420
with only a few thousand troops?

27:38.860 --> 27:40.060
A warrior's daughter?

27:40.300 --> 27:40.980
I think

27:41.500 --> 27:42.340
the great reputation

27:42.340 --> 27:43.820
of Chu Ling

27:43.940 --> 27:44.820
will just be ruined

27:44.820 --> 27:46.140
by his daughter

27:46.140 --> 27:47.260
who has a swollen head.

27:48.380 --> 27:49.100
Your Lordship,

27:49.180 --> 27:50.100
don't bother with her.

27:50.300 --> 27:51.820
I'll go teach her a lesson.

27:54.220 --> 27:54.580
Your Lordship,

27:55.140 --> 27:56.500
the Grand Princess wants to talk.

27:56.620 --> 27:57.380
The Grand Princess?

27:57.500 --> 27:58.740
What's she doing here?

28:00.260 --> 28:01.500
Since she wants to talk,

28:02.340 --> 28:03.300
tell her

28:03.500 --> 28:04.820
I have trouble walking

28:04.820 --> 28:05.620
and can't go out.

28:06.340 --> 28:07.020
However,

28:07.260 --> 28:09.260
my gate is always open to her.

28:10.300 --> 28:11.740
She can come anytime.

28:13.460 --> 28:14.340
[Xiaonan]

28:14.340 --> 28:15.180
We both know

28:15.300 --> 28:16.140
it's an ambush.

28:17.340 --> 28:18.500
If you enter his mansion,

28:18.780 --> 28:19.940
you'll be walking straight into the lion's den.

28:20.660 --> 28:21.460
If Xiaonan holds you

28:21.460 --> 28:22.780
as a hostage,

28:23.580 --> 28:24.900
the Capital will face a tough choice.

28:25.700 --> 28:26.460
You worry too much.

28:27.140 --> 28:28.420
Mr. Deng and Xie Yanfang

28:28.820 --> 28:30.020
can't wait for me to die for the state.

28:31.060 --> 28:31.940
Believe it or not,

28:32.540 --> 28:33.740
they've even prepared

28:33.740 --> 28:34.540
my posthumous title.

28:35.100 --> 28:36.180
This is no child's play.

28:37.140 --> 28:38.140
Are you really sure?

28:38.660 --> 28:39.860
I know what worries you.

28:40.260 --> 28:41.660
Lord of Xiaonan is so cunning

28:42.220 --> 28:42.980
that he even rebels

28:43.260 --> 28:44.660
in the name of guarding His Majesty.

28:44.700 --> 28:45.740
[Xiaonan]

28:45.740 --> 28:46.620
If the Grand Princess

28:46.620 --> 28:47.940
dies in his mansion,

28:48.660 --> 28:50.100
guess how history will judge him.

28:51.100 --> 28:52.220
He will be a traitor,

28:52.700 --> 28:54.060
whether he likes it or not.

28:55.060 --> 28:55.660
So...

28:59.100 --> 29:00.020
Will you

29:01.140 --> 29:02.460
take this gamble with me?

29:04.380 --> 29:04.820
Of course.

29:05.420 --> 29:06.620
Not to mention his mansion,

29:07.220 --> 29:08.940
I'll even follow you

29:10.140 --> 29:10.940
to the underworld.

29:15.580 --> 29:16.340
This time,

29:18.820 --> 29:20.340
we'll all live well.

29:23.780 --> 29:24.740
We must live.

30:06.140 --> 30:08.540
[Nan]

30:11.900 --> 30:13.100
What an impressive mansion.

30:13.940 --> 30:14.780
Look at the scale.

30:15.260 --> 30:16.980
He's so obviously showing

30:17.220 --> 30:18.580
his ambition to be the Emperor.

30:19.900 --> 30:20.660
Then

30:21.860 --> 30:23.700
I'll kill that hope of his.

31:18.620 --> 31:20.980
How could we reject the tea he offered?

31:22.980 --> 31:24.660
You've got some spine, Miss Chu.

31:26.140 --> 31:27.780
Don't you fear I may put something

31:27.820 --> 31:29.060
in the tea?

31:29.860 --> 31:30.620
I am

31:31.060 --> 31:32.460
the Grand Princess of State.

31:34.140 --> 31:35.860
I can fight battles with you

31:35.980 --> 31:37.020
and slaughter your men.

31:38.260 --> 31:40.300
If I were to die from poisoned tea,

31:40.820 --> 31:42.220
people in the world

31:42.540 --> 31:43.820
would laugh at you.

31:48.300 --> 31:49.940
Even if I were bloodthirsty,

31:50.100 --> 31:51.140
I would know

31:51.140 --> 31:52.580
I should keep worthy generals alive.

31:53.180 --> 31:55.700
Besides, I've admired General Chu.

31:56.460 --> 31:57.580
He's gone.

31:57.700 --> 31:59.380
I still count on you

31:59.420 --> 32:00.500
to inherit his legacy.

32:01.180 --> 32:02.700
How would I try to kill you?

32:03.140 --> 32:04.180
You flatter me.

32:06.460 --> 32:07.380
In that case,

32:08.100 --> 32:09.140
please withdraw your troops

32:09.140 --> 32:11.100
that are besieging the Capital.

32:12.900 --> 32:14.060
Don't let common folks die

32:14.380 --> 32:16.220
in your fight for the throne.

32:17.540 --> 32:19.260
As a general's daughter,

32:20.140 --> 32:22.060
you must be familiar with military classics.

32:25.140 --> 32:26.460
Have you read about this?

32:26.580 --> 32:28.700
Glory for one, death for thousands.

32:29.420 --> 32:31.460
New dynasty rises, the old one falls.

32:31.820 --> 32:33.580
Someone must sweep away

32:33.700 --> 32:35.180
the incense ash

32:35.940 --> 32:37.620
before burning new incense.

32:37.980 --> 32:39.100
If His Majesty

32:40.060 --> 32:41.580
grants you the Golden Seal

32:42.140 --> 32:43.580
and feudal sovereignty,

32:45.140 --> 32:46.540
will you stop the war?

32:47.780 --> 32:48.540
Your Highness,

32:48.980 --> 32:50.300
when His Lordship

32:50.340 --> 32:51.620
can get the Imperial Seal,

32:51.780 --> 32:53.620
why would he need the Golden Seal?

32:56.380 --> 32:58.300
You offered a great deal

32:58.300 --> 32:59.540
to make me retreat.

33:00.180 --> 33:01.780
But how dare a woman like you

33:02.180 --> 33:04.580
grant me feudal sovereignty?

33:05.540 --> 33:06.500
When I grant something,

33:07.220 --> 33:07.940
you will get it.

33:16.420 --> 33:17.940
Now, I understand.

33:18.500 --> 33:20.140
You aren't persuading me

33:20.580 --> 33:21.500
for the young emperor

33:21.500 --> 33:23.540
or the ministers in the court.

33:24.900 --> 33:26.580
You're trying to stop me

33:26.580 --> 33:27.780
for the sake of the people.

33:30.580 --> 33:32.500
What a saint you are.

33:34.060 --> 33:35.740
I'm not a saint.

33:38.100 --> 33:38.820
I am

33:39.220 --> 33:40.540
the Grand Princess of State.

33:41.380 --> 33:43.140
I won't see this state fall apart.

33:44.780 --> 33:46.140
Like I said,

33:46.380 --> 33:47.900
I've admired General Chu

33:48.100 --> 33:49.820
and I think highly of you.

33:50.820 --> 33:51.420
What about

33:53.340 --> 33:55.540
you and I working together?

34:01.540 --> 34:02.420
How?

34:03.740 --> 34:04.900
If I become the Emperor,

34:05.540 --> 34:07.020
Xun will be the Crown Prince

34:07.140 --> 34:08.740
and you'll be the Crown Princess.

34:09.100 --> 34:11.020
Then you'll be the Empress.

34:11.980 --> 34:13.020
I can also grant you

34:13.340 --> 34:14.900
the command over frontier troops,

34:14.980 --> 34:17.420
unrestrained by the court's Tally.

34:18.540 --> 34:19.140
Do you agree?

34:25.380 --> 34:27.180
So, being Xiao Xun's empress

34:28.460 --> 34:30.540
can get me such great power.

34:30.580 --> 34:32.260
I'm not kidding.

34:32.780 --> 34:33.500
I know.

34:35.220 --> 34:36.860
You really mean it.

34:38.100 --> 34:39.060
Too bad, though.

34:40.140 --> 34:41.500
Am I offering not enough?

34:42.020 --> 34:43.540
Feel free to make any other requests.

34:44.780 --> 34:46.300
I have only one request.

34:47.300 --> 34:48.220
I request you

34:49.100 --> 34:49.940
to stop the war.

34:54.380 --> 34:56.060
You need to understand one thing.

34:57.460 --> 34:59.060
I can persuade you.

34:59.420 --> 35:01.580
You're in no position to persuade me.

35:02.460 --> 35:04.140
I'm not here to persuade you,

35:05.140 --> 35:06.660
but threaten you.

35:09.700 --> 35:11.460
With what can you threaten me?

35:13.980 --> 35:15.220
Xiao Xun.

35:28.180 --> 35:29.900
Speaking of him,

35:30.460 --> 35:31.540
he has still kept

35:31.620 --> 35:33.140
your birthdate card.

35:33.820 --> 35:35.580
He knelt for three days and nights,

35:35.700 --> 35:37.540
swearing to marry no one but you.

35:38.140 --> 35:40.300
But you requested to annul your engagement.

35:41.340 --> 35:43.060
Xun still hasn't figured out

35:43.820 --> 35:45.620
what he did wrong.

35:46.380 --> 35:47.420
Today,

35:48.700 --> 35:50.340
I know the answer.

35:55.900 --> 35:57.740
You must be Commander Xie.

35:59.860 --> 36:01.420
I've heard a lot about you.

36:01.860 --> 36:04.020
You're as remarkable as people say.

36:05.020 --> 36:06.220
During the coup,

36:06.660 --> 36:08.900
you led a few guards to defeat ten thousand troops.

36:09.300 --> 36:10.500
You are a real hero.

36:12.580 --> 36:13.660
Your Lordship,

36:13.820 --> 36:14.900
don't be ridiculous.

36:15.820 --> 36:16.820
I broke off my engagement

36:17.140 --> 36:19.180
for the people of our state,

36:19.900 --> 36:21.580
not for romance.

36:23.620 --> 36:25.340
Narrow-minded as you are,

36:26.180 --> 36:27.700
how can you fight for the throne?

36:29.100 --> 36:30.500
What a sharp tongue.

36:31.660 --> 36:33.500
If I remember correctly, Mr. Xie,

36:34.180 --> 36:35.700
your brother

36:35.740 --> 36:37.500
also has great ambitions.

36:38.380 --> 36:39.940
If one day you meet in armed conflict,

36:40.140 --> 36:41.740
whose side will you take?

36:45.020 --> 36:46.380
I pledge loyalty to His Majesty,

36:47.180 --> 36:48.100
the Grand Princess,

36:48.700 --> 36:49.860
and the State of Chu.

36:50.820 --> 36:52.140
Anyone who hurts the imperial heir

36:52.900 --> 36:53.980
or the Grand Princess

37:04.540 --> 37:06.180
will be my enemy.

37:07.100 --> 37:09.340
You're truly a hero who is worth a hundred men.

37:11.020 --> 37:12.260
Remarkable, indeed.

37:15.180 --> 37:16.260
Do you know

37:16.620 --> 37:17.580
he isn't the only one

37:17.620 --> 37:18.620
who is worth a hundred?

37:20.380 --> 37:21.580
There's also the Longwei Army.

37:23.980 --> 37:24.900
The Longwei Army?

37:25.260 --> 37:25.980
You must've heard

37:25.980 --> 37:27.460
about the Longwei Army.

37:28.300 --> 37:29.380
They put down the rebellion

37:29.780 --> 37:31.620
while outnumbered.

37:32.260 --> 37:32.860
My father

37:32.860 --> 37:34.260
devotedly trained them.

37:34.980 --> 37:36.300
They move like ghosts

37:37.020 --> 37:38.380
and scatter around in disguise.

37:39.420 --> 37:40.740
How can you be sure

37:41.100 --> 37:43.100
there aren't any in your mansion?

37:48.300 --> 37:50.100
If you agree to retreat,

37:51.700 --> 37:52.900
I'll pretend nothing happened.

37:53.700 --> 37:55.740
So, this is how you threaten me.

37:56.940 --> 37:58.540
You want to use the Longwei Army

37:58.860 --> 38:00.100
to kill my son

38:00.700 --> 38:02.060
as well as me.

38:02.220 --> 38:03.300
You can take this

38:03.300 --> 38:04.780
as a gamble.

38:05.860 --> 38:07.340
Five thousand soldiers outside the town.

38:07.820 --> 38:09.660
Five thousand of the Longwei Army in town.

38:10.740 --> 38:11.420
If they

38:12.580 --> 38:13.660
join hands,

38:14.940 --> 38:16.260
how will you handle it?

38:22.660 --> 38:23.220
Someone.

38:23.940 --> 38:24.860
Get the rooms ready.

38:25.140 --> 38:26.780
Give Her Highness a warm reception.

38:34.340 --> 38:35.540
The secret guards in this room

38:35.540 --> 38:36.300
can be withdrawn.

38:38.420 --> 38:39.340
With poor inner power

38:39.740 --> 38:40.500
and uneven breath,

38:42.220 --> 38:42.900
they're useless.

38:49.060 --> 38:49.500
Your Lordship,

38:50.020 --> 38:50.900
Xie Yanlai

38:50.940 --> 38:52.020
is no ordinary man.

38:52.620 --> 38:53.940
When he's around Chu Zhao,

38:54.060 --> 38:55.340
we can hardly hurt her.

38:56.340 --> 38:57.100
Ning Kun,

38:57.420 --> 38:58.620
you have no idea.

38:59.140 --> 39:00.620
Chu Ling and the late emperor

39:00.620 --> 39:01.820
trained the Longwei Army.

39:02.500 --> 39:03.380
The scariest thing

39:03.380 --> 39:05.140
about them is...

39:05.620 --> 39:07.260
We don't know who they are

39:07.380 --> 39:08.220
and we don't know

39:08.220 --> 39:09.740
when or where they'll appear.

39:11.020 --> 39:12.500
They're unpreventable.

39:13.540 --> 39:15.260
Tell Xun to be on guard.

39:16.020 --> 39:16.500
Yes.

39:22.380 --> 39:23.500
In such a big courtyard,

39:24.140 --> 39:25.260
I can't even hear a bird.

39:26.500 --> 39:27.500
It's eerily quiet.

39:33.060 --> 39:33.420
Careful.

39:37.020 --> 39:38.500
Lord of Xiaonan has great taste.

39:39.020 --> 39:40.260
He even uses the best tea

39:41.020 --> 39:42.620
for mere visitors.

39:43.300 --> 39:44.020
Too bad, though.

39:44.820 --> 39:45.500
The tea got cold.

39:45.900 --> 39:46.860
We know it's an ambush

39:47.660 --> 39:48.860
and we should be more cautious.

39:49.500 --> 39:50.740
What if he poisoned the tea?

39:51.020 --> 39:51.700
He wouldn't dare.

39:53.100 --> 39:54.340
Not now, at least.

39:54.940 --> 39:55.860
What he wants

39:55.900 --> 39:57.180
is to be legitimate.

39:57.780 --> 39:59.660
If I die in his place,

40:00.020 --> 40:00.660
have a guess.

40:01.380 --> 40:02.380
Will people spit

40:02.580 --> 40:03.980
and drown this place?

40:11.020 --> 40:12.140
You know the Longwei Army

40:13.020 --> 40:14.220
isn't in Xiaonan.

40:14.820 --> 40:16.380
But you bluffed just like that.

40:17.620 --> 40:18.740
Didn't you fear that he could

40:18.780 --> 40:19.620
see through you?

40:20.020 --> 40:21.020
Let me tell you this.

40:21.380 --> 40:22.900
What makes the Longwei Army terrifying

40:23.180 --> 40:24.220
is that people believe

40:24.460 --> 40:25.660
they're everywhere.

40:33.580 --> 40:34.100
Don't worry.

40:35.500 --> 40:37.500
Someone's having a harder time.

40:38.340 --> 40:39.780
His Lordship is cautious by nature.

40:40.180 --> 40:41.260
Without a perfect plan,

40:41.420 --> 40:42.700
he wouldn't act rashly.

40:43.580 --> 40:44.820
He sent Xiao Xun to the Capital

40:45.100 --> 40:46.620
because he thought the time was right.

40:48.020 --> 40:49.460
The calmer we are,

40:50.340 --> 40:51.460
the more he will

40:51.900 --> 40:53.780
doubt his own judgment.

40:54.220 --> 40:55.780
When he thinks it's not the right time,

40:57.580 --> 40:58.940
he'll ask Xiao Xun to retreat.

40:59.460 --> 41:00.220
So, just now,

41:00.380 --> 41:01.180
you were trying

41:02.540 --> 41:03.780
to break his will,

41:04.620 --> 41:05.620
making him think

41:05.860 --> 41:06.900
his plan wasn't perfect.

41:07.300 --> 41:08.660
Then he'll lose his cool

41:09.100 --> 41:09.860
and withdraw.

41:10.180 --> 41:10.700
That's right.

41:11.140 --> 41:11.860
So, Jiu,

41:12.020 --> 41:12.900
don't be impatient.

41:13.420 --> 41:14.660
We'll just wait.

41:15.860 --> 41:17.100
We'll wait patiently

41:18.460 --> 41:19.700
until he makes his decision.

41:20.900 --> 41:21.660
I've heard

41:21.780 --> 41:22.900
this is the best scenic spot

41:22.940 --> 41:24.340
all over this mansion.

41:25.620 --> 41:26.980
Let's not waste

41:27.220 --> 41:28.540
his hospitality.

41:40.900 --> 41:45.500
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

41:45.780 --> 41:48.260
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

41:48.300 --> 41:52.340
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

41:54.580 --> 41:56.700
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

41:56.780 --> 41:58.740
♪And roars in the blaze♪

41:58.820 --> 42:02.060
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

42:02.220 --> 42:04.460
♪Fate imprisons me♪

42:04.620 --> 42:09.420
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

42:09.420 --> 42:13.620
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

42:13.620 --> 42:17.900
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

42:17.900 --> 42:23.340
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

42:23.340 --> 42:25.300
♪With no fear of the distance♪

42:25.300 --> 42:29.020
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

42:29.020 --> 42:33.460
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

42:33.460 --> 42:38.820
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

42:38.820 --> 42:42.420
♪My new pride♪

42:57.140 --> 43:00.020
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

43:00.020 --> 43:02.540
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

43:02.540 --> 43:04.480
♪Amidst the chaos♪

43:04.520 --> 43:10.120
♪I'll always be with you♪

43:10.660 --> 43:12.780
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:12.860 --> 43:14.820
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:14.900 --> 43:18.140
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:18.300 --> 43:20.540
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:20.700 --> 43:25.500
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:25.500 --> 43:29.700
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

43:29.700 --> 43:33.980
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

43:33.980 --> 43:39.420
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

43:39.420 --> 43:41.380
♪With no fear of the distance♪

43:41.380 --> 43:45.100
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

43:45.100 --> 43:49.540
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

43:50.320 --> 43:54.900
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

43:55.240 --> 43:58.500
♪My new pride♪
